# Copy to .dev.vars (git-ignored) for local development. NEVER commit real secrets.
#
# Option A — no credentials at all, fake products for design work:
COMMERCE_PROVIDER=mock

# Option B — the local fixture server (npm run fake-square), no real Square calls:
# SQUARE_ENVIRONMENT=sandbox
# SQUARE_LOCATION_ID=L0SZPKA80GMNA
# SQUARE_ACCESS_TOKEN=local-fixture
# SQUARE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4010
# SQUARE_CACHE_SECONDS=0

# Option C — real Square SANDBOX (paste your own sandbox token here, only in your local .dev.vars):
# SQUARE_ENVIRONMENT=sandbox
# SQUARE_LOCATION_ID=L0SZPKA80GMNA
# SQUARE_ACCESS_TOKEN=
# SQUARE_APPLICATION_ID=
